<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the divine economy</l><l>Christ has been placed preeminently;</l><l>May I give Him first place in all things,</l><l>So Christ may be my everything.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the divine economy</l><l>Christ, seated in the heavenlies,</l><l>Is heading up the whole universe,</l><l>Redeeming all things from the curse.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the divine economy</l><l>Christ is the one who fills all things;</l><l>He who ascended far above all,</l><l>Now fills my spirit when I call.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>In the divine economy</l><l>Christ has accomplished everything;</l><l>Christ my beginning and Christ my end,</l><l>Alpha – Omega, Praise to Him!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
